","target":"psds-track-service-request-status-user","line":221},{"title":"Register for the Government Service Portal as a constituent, business contact, or user","target":"register-gsm-portal-user","line":222},{"title":"Government Service Portal","target":"gsp-overview-public-sector","line":223}],"metadata":{"title":"Creating a government service request with Public Sector Digital Services","description":"You can create a case about a community question or issue from the Government Service Portal in Public Sector Digital Services. The Government Service Portal supports submissions by both registered and anonymous users.Create a service request as a registered user in the Public Sector Digital Services application.Create a service request as a public user in the Public Sector Digital Services application. You can submit a service request anonymously without logging in to the application.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/government-industry/psds-create-service-request-user.html","release":"australia","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":5,"breadcrumb":["Government Service Portal","Portals","Use","Public Sector Digital Services \\(PSDS\\)"],"tags":["#government-industry","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/government-industry/psds-create-service-request-user.md"},
